{
  "schema": "fablereborn.raid-node",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "Siege of the Last Lantern",
  "description": "Wave defence. Protect the Lantern (100 light) through 3 waves of 4 Gloom Crawlers, then the Gloom Warlord, who hunts the lowest-HP player. Light drains 4 per round while enemies live and 8 against 3+. Later waves are Gloom-Maddened. Between waves the party votes to rebuild the barricade (shield), tend the wounded (heal), set traps (30 AoE) or refill the Lantern (+30 light). Volley hits every enemy; Burn Lantern Oil spends 15 light on a big AoE. Next: dawn. Failure: the Lantern dies.",
  "entry": "lantern_intro",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "lantern_intro",
      "kind": "scene",
      "title": "The Last Lantern",
      "text": "A frozen village. One great lantern in the square holds back an endless dark, and things are crawling out of that dark.\n\nSurvive **three waves** and the **Warlord**. The **Lantern's light** drains while enemies live, faster against a swarm. If it goes out, all is lost. Between waves, choose how to prepare.",
      "next": "wave",
      "rules": []
    },
    {
